48_5202587497473315011_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L85E_NDK5KAQ7kNvwE9lmRZ&_nc_oc=AdrpTwzcdYl0k7bZnGWHi-btiaTpn9lh4v__Q_TqD2X-CcrqnYZT3JwPZir82w3QpRU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMax9kh8GWf-mO3wd-YMu9ESdMV7TrOJfXPkR6KcxgwZg&oe=6ACBAB24"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "NEW_NurseSim_Simlogic_Landscape_sep2026.png", "id": "1289918843184424", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1289918846517757_7025777987388135305_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3lUh94wW_hMQ7kNvwE0qzWS&_nc_oc=Adq3oyVjHqPpGn_llgj7YZLBkubXD2-7US-k1WaNDqsfoex2UW5FgnGfvNGYxevgwak&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN1j0vVn1naGXSMgVQRoe-BYZEt1j00mu8AohK9LVSnsQ&oe=6ACBAA9F"}, "display_name": "VR Nurse Simulation", "keywords": ["Skillupvr", "Nurse", "skillup", "nurse", "skillupvr"], "long_description": "VR Nurse Simulation is designed for junior healthcare professionals to practice their basic nursing skills. Developed together with a Norwegian vocational institution, the simulation pack offers multiple scenarios set in both clinical and home environments, for users to familarize themselves with ABCDE-assessment, the NEWS2 scoring system and ISBAR communication techniques.\n\n- 8 training scenarios of different patient profiles\n- Multiplayer setup\n- English and Norwegian language options\n- Intuitive, interactive and wireless\n- Compatible with Meta Quest 2 and 3\n- NEWS2 Scoring System \n- ISBAR Communication Framework\n- Facilitator control, communication and supervision capability *\n\n* Add-on application.", "short_description": "VR Nurse Simulation is designed for junior healthcare professionals to practice their basic nursing skills. Developed together with a Norwegian vocational institution, the simulation pack offers multiple scenarios set in both clinical and home environments, for users to familarize themselves with ABCDE-as